          <view class="weapp-tw-border wtu-1ifo9d6-o wtu-17r6wme-p wtu-1r2go6c-q wtu-1dl5zcs-r wtu-q1a0k8-1y" />
          <text class="weapp-tw-border wtu-1alhdmh-t wtu-1yuc2sf-g wtu-x3iljt-h">9. 深比较</text>
        </view>
        <text class="weapp-tw-border wtu-1pohc4r-i wtu-d75hc2-k">isEqual(a, b) 比较两个值是否相等（对象与数组按 JSON 文本比较，仅比较浅层数组时可用 arrayEqual）。</text>
        <view class="weapp-tw-border wtu-1jil4pd-7 wtu-1ap3b81-u wtu-1hja0uv-v wtu-hm9ihe-w wtu-1seopxb-x">
          <view class="weapp-tw-border wtu-v8h12z-0 wtu-opyb0u-m wtu-e9gpvm-2 wtu-v3y659-y wtu-aaeke-z">
